WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.640
What would happen if SCP-173, the Sculpture,&nbsp;
was put inside SCP-914, the Clockworks?

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:10.720
Rough: 173 would likely be reduced&nbsp;
to a pile of dust and rubble.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.120
Though it’d likely rebuild itself afterward.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:18.080
Coarse: We imagine this would split&nbsp;
173 into three parts - Head, Torso,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.720
and butt/legs. Once again, it wouldn’t&nbsp;
take long for him to return afterward.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:28.080
1:1: We speculate that it’d turn&nbsp;
into SCP-650, the Startling Statue.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:32.320
Fine: This could lead to a larger, faster SCP-173,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:37.600
capable of snapping more necks when eyes&nbsp;
aren’t on it, which 173 would very much enjoy.&nbsp;

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:42.800
Very Fine: Perhaps this would lead to an&nbsp;
SCP-173 the size of the Statue of Liberty,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:47.200
capable of snapping skyscrapers and stomping&nbsp;
neighborhoods when nobody is looking at it.

